During his stay on [[Coruscant]] as part of the [[New Republic Amnesty Program]]<ref name="Chapter 19" /> on [[9 ABY]]<ref name="Date" />, ex-[[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[scientist]] [[Penn Pershing]] lived in an '''apartment''' on the first floor of the [[Amnesty Housing]] complex. His apartment neighbored the one used by [[Elia Kane]] and was in the same block as [[Amnesty Officer G27]], [[Amnesty Officer M34|M34]], and [[Amnesty Officer M40|M40's]]. It included a bed, a closet for his [[Amnesty uniform]]s, as well as a desk with trinkets and a box.<ref name="Chapter 19" />

